## Project Structure

```
app/src/main/java/com/example/vgarage/
│
├── SupabaseClient.kt          # Singleton Supabase connection
├── GarageRepository.kt        # All database operations + data classes
│
├── LoginActivity.kt           # Login screen — entry point
├── DashboardActivity.kt       # Mechanic home screen (fleet stats)
├── CheckInActivity.kt         # Vehicle intake form
├── TasksActivity.kt           # Per-truck collaborative task list
├── TrucksInServiceActivity.kt # All active trucks with task progress
├── ReportsActivity.kt         # Admin analytics screen
│
└── ui/theme/
    ├── Color.kt
    ├── Type.kt
    └── Theme.kt
```

