## Assessment Rubric Reference (MAP711S)

| Criteria | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **App Architecture** | Repository pattern, singleton DB client, layered separation of UI and data |
| **Code** | Documented suspend functions, try/catch on all DB calls, meaningful naming |
| **Functionality** | Check-in, task ticking, role routing, reports, duplicate guard, auto-refresh |
| **UI & Navigation** | Jetpack Compose Material 3, consistent dark theme, progress indicators, role-based screens |
| **Presentation** | See the accompanying Technical Architecture & Developer Guide PDF |

